":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"History: Canvas comparison","spec":{"accessibility":["The two frames are labelled with their side, the View name and the version; the legend says each mark in words, so color is never the only signal.","The mode choice is a group of buttons with the current one marked."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack with outline, Text, Button, Badge, Icon, Alert); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except the stand-in View content, which is Workspace content; en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","The stand-in View shows the change list of the History Views: a changed title, a moved Pay button, an added note and a removed promotion.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A person opened a comparison of a View in the History panel and chose Side by side or Highlight changes, on a desktop or tablet layout, as a member who holds history.read.","The base state is the side-by-side mode with both frames on the canvas render context (base state, default Locale, viewport and theme), the left frame the earlier version and the right frame the later one.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the frames here hold a stand-in for the rendered View."],"intent":"Show the canvas before and after comparison of the View page, which replaces the live canvas while the History panel holds a canvas mode, as built from Adapter Widgets only: two frames of the same View in two versions on one stage, either plain or with the changed Widgets outlined.","interactionRules":["Both frames render the View in the same Variant, Locale, viewport and theme; a key that one version lacks renders that side in its base state or default and says so.","Highlight changes outlines added, changed and moved Widgets on the after frame and removed Widgets on the before frame, and names the four marks in a legend; when Widgets cannot be matched by ID, no change is outlined and the page says so.","A historical frame is read-only: it shows no comment pins, and it renders with the current Widget Runtime and Adapters, which the page says when the version recorded other Adapters or none.","The first version has nothing before it, a version without this View says so, and a frame that cannot be loaded offers Retry.","Back to the live canvas closes the comparison; the choice is offered on desktop and tablet, never on a phone."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"a4c1d702-6e2b-4f3a-9d5c-2b7e1f8a0c02"}],"requirements":["01a11a5e-1288-7f86-a1cc-9b2fd0d2bd62","01a11a5e-1232-777c-a76d-26a6d5cbcfc0","01a11a5e-13d6-7a24-92e9-9a5de720ca27","01a11a5e-1ba5-765e-966f-a681def5f472"]},"variants":{"adapters-caveat":{"requirements":["01a11a5e-1385-7484-baf3-93d865fd97a5"],"state":{"caveat":{"visible":true}}},"frame-load-failed":{"state":{"fp-b-failed":{"visible":true},"fp-b-ready":{"visible":false}}},"frame-notice":{"requirements":["01a11a5e-1331-7e9e-a98d-5ff9b265b0e8"],"state":{"notices":{"visible":true}}},"highlight-changes":{"requirements":["01a11a5e-12dc-793c-8f66-2d58c032fa19"],"state":{"fp-a-note":{"outline":"added"},"fp-a-pay":{"outline":"moved"},"fp-a-title":{"outline":"modified"},"fp-b-promo":{"outline":"removed"},"legend":{"visible":true},"modes-side-highlight":{"variant":"neutral"},"modes-side-side":{"variant":"outline"}}},"highlight-unmatched":{"requirements":["01a11a5e-12dc-793c-8f66-2d58c032fa19"],"state":{"fp-a-note":{"outline":"added"},"fp-a-pay":{"outline":"moved"},"fp-a-title":{"outline":"modified"},"fp-b-promo":{"outline":"remo